  "description": "A crystalline void-spider weaving at speed: a skittering articulated gait, a faceted plated carapace, and three tiers of web thread down to fine cross-bracing filaments. The nebula and the weaver are both graded through a psychedelic crystalline spectrum. The spring-smoothed cursor drags the gravity field, holding lunges the camera in, and clicks snap the web into expanding rings.",
